Short list of things not implemented exactly:
- The attract/title screen does not include a live demo playthrough.
- Captured-fighter behavior when the player is already a dual fighter is simplified: a freed captive docks only if the player is single; if already dual, it explodes instead of granting an extra reserve.
- Some Galaga-specific enemy formation entry choreography is approximated with curved Bezier entry groups rather than exact ROM patterns.
- Enemy bullets are not destroyed by player shots.
